OL,3,GNEWSANew home means 'big ambitions' for
OL,4,Awood enterprise
OL,5,
OL,6,FA wood recycling group's move to bigger
OL,7,Fpremises means "bigger ambitions" and
OL,8,Fhelping more people volunteer and learn
OL,9,Fnew skills, its founders said.
OL,11,FWolverhampton Wood Recycling (WWR)
OL,12,Fturns waste wood into a range of items
OL,13,Ffor sale and offers a bespoke service,
OL,14,Fthanks to its team of volunteers from
OL,15,Fits new home on Webner Industrial
OL,16,FEstate in Wolverhampton.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,360,350,200,160,0,100
