OL,3,GNEWSANew home means 'big ambitions' for
OL,4,Awood enterprise
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe larger space will lead to more
OL,7,Fcommunity activities and new projects
OL,8,Fdesigned to bring people together,
OL,9,Fincluding plans for a Repair cafe and a
OL,10,FMen's Shed, Jim Brennan from the social
OL,11,Fenterprise said.
OL,13,F"We want this to be a place where
OL,14,Fpeople can come along, learn, share
OL,15,Ftheir skills, meet others and feel that
OL,16,Fthey belong," he said.
